-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Run by script through the real loader on a NextZXOS 26.11 card
              copy, default and Enhanced; 1.0 not yet played by the owner;
              published at his request

  Replay      Enhanced: 6 recordings, 20149 frames, level 1 and levels 3, 5, 7
              and every level end by test copies: 27036 hooks run original and
              build from one state each: every register including R and all
              48K RAM: IDENTICAL; 4474 Layer 2 pictures, 137441280 pixels,
              against a picture built from the map and the plots, and the
              game's own buffer against the same model in mono: IDENTICAL; 11
              of 11 broken builds caught; 320 ABI cases; the start-up exact
              with and without NEXLOAD. Default: no hooks, byte for byte the
              1.0 build

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: through the real .NEXCLASH loader on a
              private NextZXOS 26.11 card copy, default, default with cheats,
              Enhanced and Enhanced with cheats, output byte for byte as
              nxc.py makes it, reaching play; 15-minute soak of Enhanced
              against the original with the sheet viewed; flicker check clean;
              the flip outside the play rows

  Coverage    Scripted input, no human play: level 1 at length, deaths, game
              over; levels 3, 5, 7 and all level ends by test copies; not
              reached by play: natural level completion, natural end of the
              game, Interface 2

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
